<!--
  A deterministic feed for the live-contract job, served from the runner itself.

  The job used to import an OPML of real feeds and run the contract tests
  immediately. Miniflux's poller had not fetched anything yet, so the instance
  held zero entries and both contract tests took their "too few entries" early
  return, which cargo reports as a pass. The job could go green having checked
  neither of the two API behaviours it exists to watch.

  Six entries, fixed ids and dates, no outbound network.
-->
